### FirstClub Membership — request collection (IntelliJ HTTP client / VS Code REST Client)
@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### Plans with tier options and prices
GET {{base}}/plans

### Tiers with effective benefits and unlock criteria
GET {{base}}/tiers

### Demo users
GET {{base}}/users

### Tier eligibility with per-criterion progress
GET {{base}}/users/1/tier-eligibility

### Subscribe (idempotent)
POST {{base}}/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: attempt-001

{ "userId": 1, "planCode": "MONTHLY", "tierCode": "SILVER" }

### Current membership and expiry
GET {{base}}/users/1/membership

### Place an order (drives tier progression)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "totalAmount": 2500 }

### Upgrade — immediate, prorated
POST {{base}}/subscriptions/1/upgrade
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: upgrade-001

{ "tierCode": "GOLD" }

### Downgrade — scheduled for period end
POST {{base}}/subscriptions/1/downgrade
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tierCode": "SILVER" }

### Cancel at period end
POST {{base}}/subscriptions/1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{ "immediate": false }

### Cancel immediately
POST {{base}}/subscriptions/1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{ "immediate": true }

### Audit trail
GET {{base}}/subscriptions/1/events

### Checkout preview with membership applied
POST {{base}}/checkout/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "deliveryFee": 49,
  "items": [
    { "sku": "SKU-1", "category": "ELECTRONICS", "unitPrice": 4999, "quantity": 1 },
    { "sku": "SKU-2", "category": "GROCERY", "unitPrice": 250, "quantity": 3 }
  ]
}

### Active benefits for a member
GET {{base}}/users/1/benefits

### Reconfigure a tier benefit at runtime
PUT {{base}}/admin/tiers/GOLD/benefits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "EXTRA_DISCOUNT",
  "description": "9% member discount on electronics",
  "config": { "percentage": "9", "maxDiscount": "900", "categories": "ELECTRONICS" }
}

### Reconfigure an unlock criterion at runtime
PUT {{base}}/admin/tiers/GOLD/criteria
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "MIN_ORDERS_IN_WINDOW",
  "description": "At least 2 orders in the last 30 days",
  "config": { "minOrders": "2", "windowDays": "30" }
}

### Run the expiry / renewal sweep now
POST {{base}}/admin/sweeps/lifecycle

### Run tier re-evaluation now
POST {{base}}/admin/sweeps/tier-evaluation
